51          structure of the project using function `list_files`.
52         4. Then you may need to call `read_file` function to read the content of the code files, locate the error line
53          and the reasons.
54         5. You don't need to care about the best practices and code styles, you only care about the errors in the code.
55         6. If the developer's input includes the error message, you don't need to execute the code, you can directly
56          analyze the error messages and give the reason and suggestions.
57 
58         """
59         self.search_prompt = """
60         7. You need to debug the code based on the error logs, you may need to call `web_search` function to search for
61          the solutions or reasons for the errors if needed.
